-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",348,{
[11105]="7005D380\n1\tDestroy smothercap mushrooms (total: 12)\tSmothercap can be found in northern Clovengap. Golodhrim has asked you to destroy smothercap mushrooms.\n2\tReturn to Golodhril\tGolodhril is located in Bazanmanar. You should tell Golodhril that you have removed many of the smothercap mushrooms.\n",
[11106]="7005AAA9\n1\tPlace smoke bombs (total: 6)\tLarge towers in front of Shakhajât will serve as fine targets for Klúso's smoke bombs.\n2\tTalk to Klúso\tKlúso will want to hear how well his plan to hide your movements is proceeding.\n",
[11107]="7002EF7F\n1\tInvestigate the smoke and ashes near the eaves of Fangorn\tThe place where Béortnoth recalled seeing the ashes and smoke lies to the west of Thornhope. Thane Béortnoth has asked you to investigate the cause of the smoke he saw.\n",
[11108]="70065AA1\n1\tFind the Corsair camp west of Glaniath\tAccording to Lothwen's observations, there may be a Corsair camp somewhere in the forest west of Glaniath. You ought to look for this supposed camp-site, just to confirm.\n2\tDefeat Bukhád at his camp\tYou have discovered a Corsair camp west of Glaniath. It seems a man named Bukhád leads the Corsairs here. You should defeat him.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Bukhád.\n",
[11109]="7000E5BE\n1\tCheck on Ida at the supply-encampment\tIda's supply-encampment is to the south of Pynti-peldot, next to the road and near the entrance to the ice canyons. Lauri has asked you to investigate Ida's supply-encampment and make sure she is not hurt.\n",
[11110]="70025CB3\n1\tBurn the rowboats (total: 4)\tRowboats can be found along the coast of Rantost. Wal Simpkins asked you to burn the rowboats around the island.\n2\tTalk to Wal Simpkins on Rantost\tWal Simpkins is at a small camp at the south-east corner of Rantost. Wal Simpkins will be pleased to hear the rowboats have been burned.\n",
[11111]="70062F3A\n1\tCollect spider chitin (total: 8)\030Collect bear meat (total: 4)\030Collect huorn branches (total: 6)\tHenbran has asked you to collect bear meat, spider chitin, and huorn branches from creatures in the Old Forest. The Old Forest is in northern Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Henbran\tYou have collected all of the items Henbran asked you to gather for her soup recipe. You should bring them to her in the Old Forest.\n",
[11112]="70015E24\n1\tReturn to Ruidhriel\030Collect charred wood (total: 10)\tCharred wood can be found on the Burnt Tor, west of Ruidhriel. Ruidhriel has asked that you gather charred wood for her to study in hopes of finding out what happened there.\n",
[11113]="7004CE46\n1\tDestroy smuggled goods (total: 10)\tSmuggled goods can be found inside the smugglers' hideout in Lake-town. You should destroy smuggled goods.\n2\tTalk to Dagrun\tDagrun can be found in the Trade Commission Headquarters. You should talk to Dagrun.\n",
[11114]="7006AB60\n1\tTalk to the Temámir Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr, in southern Khabârkhad\tKhôltekh has asked you to go to Deshûkh, the Blood Market, to rescue a group of kidnapped Umbari nobles. First you must go see the Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr, the Temámir guard outpost in Khabârkhad.\n2\tDefeat smugglers (total: 8)\030Rescue first kidnapped noble\030Rescue second kidnapped noble\030Rescue third kidnapped noble\tNuru has told you that the Blood Market is located south-west of here, in Dil-irmíz, the Berths.\n3\tReturn to Khôltekh in the Hall of the Kindred\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, the Hall of the Kindred.\n",
[11115]="70046C2F\n1\tTalk to the captain of the Rangers at Aelin Veren\tThe captain can be found somewhere among the Rangers at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien. You have arrived at Aelin Veren and have heard the voices of Rangers and Southrons nearby. You should investigate and see if you can aid the Rangers.\n2\tTalk to the captain of the Rangers at Aelin Veren\tThe captain of the Rangers in Aelin Veren can be found amongst his kin, guarding a group of Haradrim prisoners. You have discovered a group of Rangers holding four Haradrim captive at Aelin Veren. You should investigate and see if your aid is needed.\n",
[11116]="700077C7\n1\tBring the snapper-shells and meat to Emma Rosethorn\030Collect chunks of snapper-meat (total: 15)\030Collect snapper-shells (total: 5)\tSnapper-turtles can be found on the islands and along the shore of Nen Harn, to the east of the Hengstacer Farm. Emma Rosethorn is at the Hengstacer Farm, west of Nen Harn. Emma Rosethorn asked you to bring her some snapper shells and meat for her soup.\n",
[11117]="70040EC1\n1\tDefeat marsh turtles (total: 10)\tMarsh turtles can be found in the marshlands to the south of Makham Mijann in Belfalas. You have encountered angered marsh turtles in the marshlands near Tadrent and should cull their numbers for the good of the people.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many marsh turtles near Makham Mijann.\n",
[11118]="700654B8\n1\tDestroy blocks of shoddy stone (total: 8)\tDingási has asked you to find and destroy the yellowed blocks that have been snuck into piles of superior stone across the Harlond.\n2\tReturn to Dingási\tYou should let Dingási know that you have pulverized many blocks of shoddy stone. Dingási is in the Harlond.\n",
[11119]="70047D5A\n1\tFind the first hidden Orc scout in the noble's house ruins\030Find the second hidden Orc scout in the noble's house ruins\030Find the third hidden Orc scout in the noble's house ruins\tHidden Orc scouts can be found in the noble's house ruins. Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.\n2\tFind the first hidden Orc scout in the farm house ruins\030Find the second hidden Orc scout in the farm house ruins\030Find the third hidden Orc scout in the farm house ruins\tHidden Orc scouts can be found in the farm house ruins. Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.\n3\tFind the first hidden Orc scout in the stable ruins\030Find the second hidden Orc scout in the stable ruins\tHidden Orc Scouts can be found in the stable ruins. Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.\n4\tFind the first hidden Orc scout in the store house ruins\030Find the second hidden Orc scout in the store house ruins\030Find the third hidden Orc scout in the store house ruins\tHidden Orc scouts can be found in the store house ruins. Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.\n5\tFind the first hidden Orc scout in the merchant's shop ruins\030Find the second hidden Orc scout in the merchant's shop ruins\tHidden Orc scouts can be found in the merchant's shop ruins. Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.\n6\tFind the first hidden Orc scout in the inn ruins\030Find the second hidden Orc scout in the inn ruins\tHidden Orc scouts can be found in the inn ruins. Venture into the ruins in Noman-lands with Faroth and find hidden Orc scouts.\n7\tReturn to Mablung\tMablung can be found at the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should return to Mablung.\n",
[11120]="7002D055\n1\tSearch for possible ingredients of the ingested substance\030Search for whatever contained the ingested substance\tWhatever caused the rat to die can be found somewhere in the tower. You should search for whatever the rat ingested that would have caused it to die.\n",
[11121]="700529D5\n1\tTalk to Ingelfled\tIngelfled can be found in the village Arhaim in Duskenvale. You talk to Ingelfled.\n2\tCollect truffles (total: 8)\tIngelfled said that truffles could be found in the boar wallow south of Arhaim. You should bring Noffer to the boar wallow and have him search for truffles. Noffer must be present to find the truffles.\n3\tTalk to Ingelfled\tIngelfled can be found in the village of Arhaim in Duskenvale. You should bring the truffles and Noffer to Ingelfled.\n4\tOffer a truffle to Noffer\tNoffer can be called with the pig whistle. You should talk to Noffer and offer him a truffle.\n",
[11122]="70018C15\n1\tGather piles of snow (total: 8)\tPiles of snow can be found west of Frerin's Court, south of the gates to Thorin's Hall. Glói has asked you to gather snow from several piles outside Thorin's Hall.\n2\tBring the piles of snow to Glói\tGlói is inside Thorin's Hall. Glói will be eager to fill his cart with the snow you have gathered.\n",
[11123]="70034E51\n1\tSearch the roadway for signs of the Orcs' plans\030Search the roadway for any foes the Orcs face\030Scout the roadway for sign of an Orc-leader\030Destroy torches at the roadway's edge (total: 6)\tHúna has asked that you scout the eastern edge of the Orc roadway through the Balewood and steal torches from their keeping.\n2\tTalk to Húna\tHúna can be found in the hidden cave in southern Balewood. You have scouted the path along the eastern border of the Orc roadway and destroyed a substantial number of torches. You should return to Húna and inform him of what you have seen.\n",
[11124]="700300DF\n1\tKill salamanders (total: 7)\tThe Salamanders inhabit the swamp just to the north of Harwick. You should defeat salamanders to keep the refugees safe.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have done a great kindness to the refugees at Harwick who survived the siege of Langhold, for the salamanders crept too near to leave them with much comfort. You helped to lessen their hardship.\n",
[11125]="700479C9\n1\tDefeat Mordor Firestarters (total: 8)\tMordor Firestarters can be found in the wilds of Ithilien, south of Cair Andros. You should defeat Mordor Firestarters.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have defeated many of the encroaching Mordor Firestarters. You should speak to Thurindol with news of your success.\n",
[11126]="7006AAE7\n1\tDefeat cultists in Tâkhdar (total: 3)\tDefeat cultists guarding the mysterious artifact throughout Tâkhdar, the Cellars of Umbar.\n2\tSearch the cultists' coffer in their camp in the centre of Tâkhdar\tJâbex's artifact lies within the cultists' coffer at their camp somewhere near the centre of Tâkhdar.\n3\tReturn to Jâbex with news of the artifact\tJâbex can be found in the cross-roads of Umbar-môkh. Jâbex will doubtlessly be relieved to have the artifact back in his possession.\n4\tSubmerge the artifact in the courtyard fountain\tThe fountain can be found in the cross-roads on the western side of Tâkhdar. Jâbex has asked you to negate the artifact's power and end its hold on him by submerging it in a fountain inside the cross-roads courtyard.\n5\tThe artifact must soak for some time\tDouse the artifact in water, ensuring its curious mechanisms are thoroughly cleansed of all power.\n6\tJâbex is waiting by in the cross-roads of Tâkhdar\tJâbex is waiting in the south-western side of Tâkhdar, at the cross-roads. Jâbex will be pleased to learn he is finally free of the artifact's hold.\n",
[11127]="70039A10\n1\tPatrol the road west out of Middlemead\tThe road to the Stonedeans can be found at the western edge of Middlemead in northern Kingstead. Béored has asked you to investigate the progress of his shipment. You should patrol the road west of Middlemead in pursuit of the cart.\n2\tPatrol further along the road to the Stonedeans\tThe road to the Stonedeans can be found at the western edge of Middlemead in northern Kingstead. You have begun your patrol of the road, but have yet to encounter a cart. You should continue your patrol.\n3\tSearch the ruined cart\tThe ruined cart can be found off the north side of the road to the Stonedeans from Middlemead. You have encountered a damaged fence and marks of a cart rumbling off the roadway. You should now approach the cart.\n4\tThe stock can be found inside or nearby the ruined cart along the road west from Middlemead. You have discovered the cart's stock largely intact, and should recover it for Béored.\t\n5\tExamine the empty barrel at the wrecked cart\tThe empty barrel can be found near the wrecked cart off the road west of Middlemead. You have recovered what you could of the stock. You should now examine the empty barrel to discern its contents and their whereabouts.\n6\tTalk to Béored\tBéored can be found at the traders' pavillion in central Middlemead. You have recovered what you could of Béored's stock, and prevented the Dunlendings from stealing more of his goods. You should now return to Béored.\n",
[11128]="70032FAE\n1\tHadâd-mezer can be found to the south-east of Anazârmekhem in the Flaming Deeps, or north-west of Bensi's camp. You should follow the sounds of battle and search for survivors at Hadâd-mezer.\t\n",
[11129]="7001C686\n1\tTalk to Radagast\tYou have travelled with Radagast into the corrupted swamp of Agamaur. Aid him as he travels to the Eglain-encampment to the west.\n2\tTalk to Dannasen\tThe leader of the shades resides at the seemingly abandoned Eglain-encampment. The defeat of Dour-root has opened the way into the western ruins, where the shades Radagast spoke of dwell. Radagast asked that you entreat with Dannasen, their leader, for their aid.\n3\tDefeat Neven\tNeven's throne is further northward into the ruins. Neven holds some sway over the shade-captain, Dannasen. Perhaps if you speak with him you may find a way to alter Dannasen's orders.\n4\tSpeak to Dannasen\tDannasen lingers at the Eglain-encampment to the south of Neven's throne. Neven, the shades' commander, was actually a wight summoned by Ivar to contain the shades. With his destruction, Dannasen may now be willing to aid you.\n5\tFollow Radagast deeper into Agamaur\tFollow Radagast as he moves deeper into Agamaur. Dannasen, renewed, called forth his men to battle and opened the way westward. It may be that now you will be able to reach Elsa and Eriac.\n6\tTalk to Elsa the Bold\tTalk to Elsa to learn more about her battles in Agamaur. Thanks to Dannasen and his men, the way westward into Agamaur was opened, and you were able to reach Elsa and Eriac.\n7\tSpeak to Radagast\tThe gate into Garth Agarwen lies to the north. Elsa has sent you to seek Ivar at Garth Agarwen and put an end to him.\n8\tSpeak to Radagast\tSpeak to Radagast to see if there is something else he would have you do. Radagast has driven the Gaunt-lord Ivar from Agamaur and stopped his nefarious plans... for now.\n",
[11130]="7001520B\n1\tUse the white cloth strip to test the water\030Find a good spot to test the water\tThe water of the Water-works is west of the Rotting Cellar. Sylfa told you to take the white cloth he gave you and dip it in the water of the Water-works.\n2\tBring the soaked green cloth strip to Sylfa at the Rotting Cellar\tSylfa is in the Rotting Cellar, east of the Water-works. You dipped the white cloth strip in the water, and it turned green. You should return it to Sylfa at once.\n",
[11131]="70062DE3\n1\tReturn to where you found the axe in south-western Tharbad\tWoodcutter Huel asked you to return to where you found the axe, in south-western Tharbad, and to see if you can find and help its missing owner.\n2\tSearch to the south-west for the missing owner of the axe\tThe earth is trampled to the south-west.\n3\tFind the unfortunate owner of the axe you found\tThe earth is trampled to the south-west.\n4\tTalk to Woodcutter Huel just inside the southern entrance to Tharbad\tWoodcutter Huel is waiting just inside the southern entrance to Tharbad for news of the axe's owner.\n",
[11132]="70007313\n1\tTalk to Penglir\tPenglir is at Duillond, south-east of Gondamon. Celairant asked you to return to Penglir at Duillond and explain why he feels unworthy to bear the bow, having lost it once already to the dwarf-brigand Starkath.\n",
[11133]="7002D065\n1\tFind more of the blue fabric\tScraps of blue fabric can likely be found in the Eorlsmead Tower. You should search the tower for more scraps of this strange-hued cloth.\n",
[11134]="7002F918\n1\tCollect unfamiliar fish from Orc scavengers and defilers\tThe Orcs among the western farmsteads seem to be in possession of a strange fish. Collecting samples of the strange fish these Orcs carry might be helpful in determining a cause.\n2\tCollect unfamiliar fish from Orc scavengers and defilers (total: 3)\tThe Orcs among the western farmsteads seem to be in possession of the strange fish. Collecting samples of the strange fish these Orcs carry might be helpful in determining a cause.\n3\tAsk Cyneswith about the presence of the unusual fish\tCyneswith rests behind the large Springview Estate, to the east. Perhaps showing these fish to a local, such as Cyneswith, will uncover the cause for the Orcs having them in possession.\n",
[11135]="70057F25\n1\tPlace floral arrangements (quantity: see journal)\tThe Houses of Lore are located on the Fifth Tier of Minas Tirith. You should decorate the Houses of Lore with the floral arrangements.\n2\tReturn to Merilien\tThe wedding planner can be found on the Seventh Tier of Minas Tirith. You should let the wedding planner know you have placed the arrangements.\n",
[11136]="70028370\n1\tInvestigate Plas-maru\tNaeglanc is at Echad Naeglanc in the Bonevales. You should speak with Naeglanc when you are ready to leave for Plas-maru.\n2\tSpeak to Naeglanc in Echad Naeglanc\tSpeak to Naeglanc in Echad Naeglanc.\n",
})
